('00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000', 'Welche Angriffsvektoren nutzt Social Engineering im Anwendersupport?', 4, '[{"text": "E-Mails", "correct": true, "because": "Phishing-Angriffe"}, {"text": "Telefonanrufe", "correct": true, "because": "Vishing"}, {"text": "USB-Sticks", "correct": true, "because": "Baiting"}, {"text": "Systemupdates", "correct": false, "because": "Technische Maßnahme"}]'),
